{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "assets.extract@2",
  "title": "流水线一：完整资产设计与生图提示词",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "assets"
  ],
  "x-contract": {
    "heading": "【受保护输出契约：流水线一】",
    "layout": "lines",
    "items": "assets",
    "unit": "个资产",
    "format": "输出JSON Lines，一行一个完整资产对象；不写外层数组、Markdown、解释或自检过程。",
    "rowsIntro": "每行包含以下字段；已有资产复用标准名称，不重复初始设定，但补充证据、关系、状态和新子卡。",
    "requirement": "每场至少输出发生地environment；首次建卡有中文外观、英文摘要和完整generation_prompt。",
    "rules": [
      "原文事实、推导、设计建议分开。人、物、场独立，主体不重复；name稳定，aliases禁止杯子、机器、小伙子等歧义泛称。已有确认身份与图片不覆盖。",
      "先通读全篇决定主卡：主叙事时段最常见的干燥、中性稳定形象为主卡，不能因回忆先出现就把年轻/淋湿定为主卡。其他年龄阶段、临时雨湿及换装分别写variants，scene绑定到实际发生轮次。主卡不抱独立道具；身份锚点跨子卡继承。",
      "generation_prompt保存完整可执行生图提示词，不受prompt_en摘要长度影响：角色为正面头像、90度侧脸、颈部以下正面身体、含头背面全身四宫格；场景为空人物的微缩空间总览；道具为独立空置本体。媒介与项目一致，不能写相冲突的三视图要求。",
      "微缩场景按真实空间类型设计：围合室内保留实际四墙和门窗，半室外保留顶棚与敞开边界，外景表达道路建筑地形，不能凭空添加四墙或宋式陈设。记录固定地标与可站立anchors，不为凑数虚构结构。",
      "分析不漏物件，但仅有独立制作、跨镜识别、关键动作或特写价值的道具独立建卡。背景陈设在spatial_layout记录，普通消耗品合理归组。道具production_priority为high/medium/low，低优先级默认不排图。",
      "design保存role、identity_appearance、clothing、body_description、prop_design、spatial_layout、production_priority，characters/props/environments引用真实资产标准名。evidence为{kind:原文/推导/设计建议,location,text}，states为{location,trigger,state}。阶段损伤磨亮换轮不得倒灌到初始图。",
      "appearance为600字符以内中文摘要；prompt_en为1200字符以内英文摘要；generation_prompt保留完整设计，最多16000个JS字符串长度单位。颜色HEX仅使用实际色卡；palette_hint只写颜色名。",
      "variants仅角色使用，每项写label、kind、scenes、appearance、prompt_en、generation_prompt、start_after。kind必须是单个字符串：服装变化写\"costume\"，状态或年龄阶段写\"state\"；只能选择其中一个，不允许斜杠组合或其他值。每项无论新增还是复用，都要完整重述appearance、prompt_en及本阶段四宫格generation_prompt，三个字段不得留空；复用母卡允许留空的规则不适用于variants内的这三个字段。继承身份并只变原文授权差异，先核对动作主体与子卡母卡一致。first_scene和scenes使用本轮给定的运行场序。"
    ]
  },
  "properties": {
    "assets": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "category",
          "name",
          "aliases",
          "appearance",
          "prompt_en",
          "generation_prompt",
          "first_scene",
          "palette_hint",
          "design",
          "anchors",
          "variants"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "category": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "character",
              "environment",
              "prop"
            ]
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "aliases": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "appearance": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "prompt_en": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "generation_prompt": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "完整生图提示词：人物四宫格、场景微缩空间母版、独立道具本体；已有资产未改外观时可空"
          },
          "first_scene": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "palette_hint": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "design": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "设计字段类型必须严格遵守下列定义：role、identity_appearance、clothing、prop_design、body_description、spatial_layout均为字符串，不嵌套对象；production_priority仅high/medium/low。无关字符串写空字符串，数组写空数组。新人物必须有role/identity_appearance/clothing；新道具必须有body_description/production_priority；新场景必须有spatial_layout。每行包含原文依据，已有资产仍补充本场依据与状态。",
            "properties": {
              "role": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "identity_appearance": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "clothing": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "prop_design": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "production_priority": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "high",
                  "medium",
                  "low"
                ]
              },
              "body_description": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "只描述道具本体及固定部件；不含使用者、关联道具、摆放关系或后续状态"
              },
              "spatial_layout": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "characters": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "props": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "environments": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "evidence": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "kind",
                    "location",
                    "text"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "kind": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "原文",
                        "推导",
                        "设计建议"
                      ]
                    },
                    "location": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "text": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "states": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "location",
                    "trigger",
                    "state"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "location": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "trigger": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "state": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "anchors": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "variants": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "label",
                "kind",
                "scenes",
                "appearance",
                "prompt_en",
                "generation_prompt"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "label": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "变体名，如 护士服、淋湿"
                },
                "kind": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "costume",
                    "state"
                  ],
                  "description": "costume（服装）或 state（状态）"
                },
                "scenes": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "minimum": 1
                  },
                  "description": "用这套形象的场序"
                },
                "appearance": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "和主形象不同的服装或状态"
                },
                "prompt_en": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "该子卡四宫格英文摘要，禁止沿用三视图"
                },
                "start_after": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "仅在场中动作之后生效时，逐字引用触发动作并写明段落；整场适用写空字符串。非空时禁止按整场自动替换，需在后续镜头按该动作边界选用。"
                },
                "generation_prompt": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "该子卡本阶段完整四宫格提示词，不能只写差异"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "只有角色写：换了服装或状态的各套形象（子卡）"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
